            <p class="tap-hint" style="margin: 10px 0 0;">You don’t need to jump to stage 5 — start where you are. Key ideas: <span class="term" data-t="etl">ETL</span>, <span class="term" data-t="medallion">medallion architecture</span>, <span class="term" data-t="uns">Unified Namespace</span>, <span class="term" data-t="aas">AAS</span>.</p>
