              <div class="pilot"><div class="ls"><span class="bg-D">D</span><span class="bg-B">B</span></div><h3>Work-order tracking</h3><p>Follow every <span class="term" data-t="wo">work order</span> through the shop floor and warn people when one is at risk of being late.</p></div>
              <div class="pilot"><div class="ls"><span class="bg-A">A</span><span class="bg-D">D</span></div><h3>Shop-floor simulation</h3><p>A <span class="term" data-t="twin">digital twin</span> fed with live sensor data to run “what if?” scenarios for planning.</p></div>
